            "question": "How fast do you ship?",
            "answer": "<p>Lightning fast shipping from California, Monday to Friday. Free US shipping on $40+ in plate frames. International orders may owe import VAT/duties on delivery. Current processing and delivery times are in our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>"
