        "f2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will this fit my car?",
            "answer": "<p>We make two sizes: US standard (12″×6″) and US standard flipped (12″×6″, tags on the bottom). Choose your size on the product page. Every frame comes individually bagged.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the material?",
            "answer": "<p>Injection-molded ABS plastic with UV-resistant printed graphics. Customers run them from Phoenix to Seattle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return it?",
            "answer": "<p>Arrived broken, or we got your order wrong? We’ll replace it free. Changed your mind? Returns are accepted under our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refund Policy</a>; refunds are the item price minus return shipping.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you make custom frames?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Minimum order is 5 units for fully custom designs. Email <a href=\"mailto:badtasteworldwide@gmail.com\">badtasteworldwide@gmail.com</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this legal on my plates?",
            "answer": "<p>Our frames are designed to leave the plate number and state name visible on standard US plates. Laws vary: some states (including California, Vehicle Code §5201) prohibit covering any of the plate’s lettering, registration stickers or slogans. Check your state’s vehicle code before installing. Not legal advice.</p>"
          }
        }
